ll, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_12", "type": "text", "x": 2090.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 212984477, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 949539217, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "6 - When they book, they get a\nconfirmation right away and\nreminders before the visit", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_11", "originalText": "6 - When they book, they get a\nconfirmation right away and\nreminders before the visit", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_13", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2426, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 200071089, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 571981486, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_14"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_46"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_47"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_14", "type": "text", "x": 2438.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1243862423, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1800188483, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "7 - After the appointment they\nget a follow-up text, or a\nrebook link if they missed it", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_13", "originalText": "7 - After the appointment they\nget a follow-up text, or a\nrebook link if they missed it", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_15", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2774, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 619570853, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 505913793, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_16"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_47"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_48"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_16", "type": "text", "x": 2786.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1324919353, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 776213900, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "8 - Their opportunity moves\ndown your pipeline on its own\nat each step", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_15", "originalText": "8 - Their opportunity moves\ndown your pipeline on its own\nat each step", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_17", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3326, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 442620899, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 806899910, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_18"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_48"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_49"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_18", "type": "text", "x": 3338.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1599435268, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 418461139, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "9 - The right person on your\nteam gets a text and a task\nfor the lead", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_17", "originalText": "9 - The right person on your\nteam gets a text and a task\nfor the lead", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_19", "type": "rectangle", "x": 3876, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 269676600, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 255985077, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_20"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_49"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_50"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_20", "type": "text", "x": 3888.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 884585952, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2132084005, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "10 - I review your existing\nworkflows for conflicts, like\ntwo on the same trigger", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_19", "originalText": "10 - I review your existing\nworkflows for conflicts, like\ntwo on the same trigger", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_21", "type": "rectangle", "x": 4224, "y": 8, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#444444", "backgroundColor": "#e9e9e9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1836494975, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1349251824, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_22"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_50"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_22", "type": "text", "x": 4236.0, "y": 21.875, "width": 256, "height": 56, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1999744785, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1946412081, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "11 - Then I run a test lead\nfrom form to booking to make\nsure each message sends once", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_21", "originalText": "11 - Then I run a test lead\nfrom form to booking to make\nsure each message sends once", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "arrow_38", "type": "arrow", "x": 212, "y": 50, "width": 68, "height": 1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opac